Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Nutrition: A Descriptive Comparison of ChatGPT‐ and Dietitian‐Planned Diets for Chronic Disease Scenarios#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Nutrition: A Descriptive Comparison of ChatGPT‐ and Dietitian‐Planned Diets for Chronic Disease Scenarios#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Nutrition: A Descriptive Comparison of ChatGPT‐ and Dietitian‐Planned Diets for Chronic Disease Scenarios#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Nutrition: A Descriptive Comparison of ChatGPT‐ and Dietitian‐Planned Diets for Chronic Disease Scenarios#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/TCV34HCG","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/PXBZQR55?page=1&annotation=TUBYWRNJ","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/PXBZQR55?page=1&annotation=BMKRLF2I","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/PXBZQR55?page=1&annotation=U69NBCDG","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 4","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/PXBZQR55?page=4&annotation=FVAGIEXU","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/PXBZQR55?page=6&annotation=492HCKES","line":39}],"metadata":{"Title":"Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Nutrition: A Descriptive Comparison of ChatGPT‐ and Dietitian‐Planned Diets for Chronic Disease Scenarios","Authors":"Tuba Onay, Duygu Bekar, Ezgi Çoban, Nergiz Doğan, Uğur Günşen","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.1111/jhn.70135","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"This study aimed to assess the reliability and appropriateness of ChatGPT in creating diet plans for individuals with obesity and diet‐related non‐communicable chronic diseases. Dietary plans were generated by both a registered dietitian and ChatGPT for hypothetical individuals with identical clinical profiles and conditions. These plans were then evaluated comparatively in terms of nutritional adequacy, safety, individualization and practicality.","Findings":"ChatGPT‐generated diets demonstrated notable deficiencies in meeting specific energy and nutrient requirements and lacked personalization based on individual health needs. In several cases, contraindicated foods were included. These findings highlight the potential risks of using AI tools in clinical dietetics without professional oversight. Ethical and safety considerations are critical when integrating AI into healthcare services.","Conclusions":"ChatGPT cannot currently substitute for individualized dietary counselling provided by qualified dietitians, particularly due to its inability to offer tailored motivation, emotional support or clinically safe recommendations. Nevertheless, further research is warranted to optimize the role of AI in diet planning and to enhance its integration into personalized nutrition care.Our findings reveal that although ChatGPT can produce readable and well ‐structured meal plans, it consistently failed to meet critical clinical nutrition standards —especially in the context of non ‐communicable diseasesTo enhance the utility of AI in clinical nutrition, LLMs must integrate with guideline‐specific knowledge bases such as ADA, KDOQI and ESPEN. Prompt engineering must include safety filters that recognize and exclude contraindicated nutrients.  Hybrid models should be developed, combining AI‐generated plans with real‐time dietitian oversight. Training data should include diverse cultural and medical dietary patterns, not only general wellness content. These steps could increase the credibility and clinical relevance of AI tools in the field of dietetics and medical nutrition therapy.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"22ep2k","at":1774939552908}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/onayArtificialIntelligenceClinical2025a.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.04171279,0.00474809,0.01589442,-0.00568785,-0.04312113,-0.01318598,0.00291502,0.07164712,0.02065914,-0.0016574,-0.00839735,-0.10234149,0.02385855,0.05385542,0.06898513,0.00911552,0.02783329,0.00294641,0.00258856,0.04559053,0.04780362,-0.03953293,0.01592922,-0.01099821,-0.00650721,0.01792328,0.00796713,-0.01937614,-0.04409736,-0.20639761,0.02689674,0.01915964,0.05353595,-0.04953813,-0.05755656,0.02593816,-0.00639538,0.06599535,-0.03450774,0.01250844,0.03095106,-0.00272239,0.02174994,-0.01589052,0.02361097,-0.01661345,-0.06213544,-0.01680081,-0.07486749,-0.00807914,0.01061421,-0.00438007,0.03155809,0.03952146,0.01465159,0.02475917,0.02440796,0.02963703,0.0251098,0.07507379,0.00530506,0.07903502,-0.19739021,0.08856541,-0.00048093,0.04879254,-0.06593277,0.02923832,0.03926199,-0.023502,-0.05112865,0.00321546,0.04578408,0.02670537,0.01369836,0.03730817,0.03599002,-0.06598121,0.03780152,0.02381842,-0.00412624,0.07910831,-0.06847525,0.00831282,-0.05736837,-0.04492084,-0.0107799,-0.0661689,0.01808737,0.00279495,-0.02702992,-0.0553132,0.00298937,0.0117852,0.01255822,0.01047552,-0.02597791,-0.04492429,-0.06555952,0.1041514,-0.02646217,-0.03938722,-0.01556448,0.05334082,0.03152099,-0.05629317,-0.08095568,-0.07885981,-0.0005247,0.03293253,-0.03736388,0.0250421,0.03197358,0.00298695,-0.03340461,0.08821006,0.10523063,0.00824362,0.04257043,0.03935864,-0.04664823,0.03562272,0.05770338,0.01358761,0.01040838,-0.01511311,0.02837903,0.04929817,-0.00861124,0.00218002,0.10181538,0.02407826,-0.03616843,0.01119096,0.01473765,-0.0373056,0.01300313,-0.04448403,-0.00073255,0.00640416,-0.04549241,0.00601525,0.00999716,-0.09800335,-0.01697054,0.14989249,0.04508506,0.02890517,-0.06178121,-0.04453981,0.06349863,0.00592652,-0.01681511,0.01537009,0.02427905,0.01347917,-0.00361057,0.02163437,-0.055